### ===================================================================
### PENGUJIAN API PENAMAS - FITUR F-01: KELOLA AKUN PENGGUNA (SPRINT 1)
### ===================================================================

### 1. Menampilkan Daftar Pengguna (GET)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/users
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. PBI-001: Registrasi Akun Baru & Role (POST)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/users
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Arjuna Pandawa",
  "email": "arjunapandawa088@gmail.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "password_confirmation": "password123",
  "role": "petugas"
}

###

### 3. PBI-002: Ubah Data & Hak Akses Pengguna (PUT)
# Ganti angka 1 dengan ID pengguna yang ingin diubah
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/users/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Arjuna Pandawa Koordinator",
  "email": "arjunapandawa088@gmail.com",
  "role": "admin"
}

###

### 4. PBI-003: Hapus Akun Pengguna (DELETE)
# Ganti angka 1 dengan ID pengguna yang ingin dihapus
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/users/1
Accept: application/json

